WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.400
Beautiful, and built for your game. Start with purpose.

00:03.400 --> 00:07.800
Define shape, light and materials through an actual sample.

00:07.800 --> 00:12.000
One visual language, distinct silhouettes. Extend the family.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.200
Check a composited board at explicit study sizes.

00:16.200 --> 00:20.200
Reduce surface noise; retain identity, action and space.

00:20.200 --> 00:24.000
One team, one visual memory. Share the project pack.
